WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.247
Welcome to StoryCast.

2
00:00:02.547 --> 00:00:07.260
StoryCast shares short stories from young people across Rwanda.

3
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:14.420
Entrepreneurs, students, artists and activists, telling their stories in their own words.

4
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:20.312
Every story comes with a full transcript, and every video has captions.

5
00:00:20.612 --> 00:00:24.719
You can use the whole site with a keyboard or a screen reader.

6
00:00:25.019 --> 00:00:30.513
Pick a story, press play, or read along. Thank you for listening.
